1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,280
Day 12 of the zombie outbreak.

2
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:03,760
You're locked inside a gas station...

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:05,160
and someone knocks.

4
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:10,270
Every highway gas station has a night window: a
steel drawer for passing cigarettes

5
00:00:10,290 --> 00:00:12,010
to customers after midnight.

6
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:13,630
The knock comes again.

7
00:00:13,650 --> 00:00:17,450
You crawl to the window, and you slide
the drawer open one inch.

8
00:00:17,770 --> 00:00:19,630
Tonight, a voice comes through it.

9
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:20,290
A woman.

10
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:21,130
Trucker jacket.

11
00:00:21,150 --> 00:00:21,750
Hands up.

12
00:00:21,770 --> 00:00:22,390
'Please.

13
00:00:22,430 --> 00:00:23,370
I'm not bitten.'

14
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:24,650
Her name is Dee.

15
00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:27,110
Her truck jackknifed a mile
down the highway.

16
00:00:27,130 --> 00:00:28,670
And she has news.

17
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:33,130
The radio says the National Guard will run an
evacuation point at the county

18
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:33,450
stadium.

19
00:00:33,470 --> 00:00:34,750
Eighteen days from now.

20
00:00:34,770 --> 00:00:36,030
Six miles away.

21
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:38,200
Problem four isn't zombies.

22
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,200
It's people.

23
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:41,140
Open the door, and you get a partner...

24
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:43,880
or someone who takes everything you have.

25
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,040
What would you do?

26
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:45,660
Think about it.

27
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:47,560
Because you don't open the door.

28
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:50,780
You slide two bottles of water through
the drawer instead.

29
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:51,480
She nods...

30
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,260
and walks back into the rain.

31
00:00:53,410 --> 00:00:54,790
Twelve days later...

32
00:00:54,810 --> 00:00:55,330
headlights.

33
00:00:55,810 --> 00:00:57,190
A pickup truck rolls in.

34
00:00:57,210 --> 00:00:57,910
Three men.

35
00:00:57,930 --> 00:00:59,050
Empty gas cans.

36
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:00,390
And in the passenger seat...

37
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:00,890
Dee.

38
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:02,460
They pound on the shutter.

39
00:01:02,480 --> 00:01:04,520
'Open up, and nobody gets hurt.'

40
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:05,840
Was Dee their prisoner...

41
00:01:05,860 --> 00:01:07,200
or their guide?

42
00:01:07,220 --> 00:01:08,460
Would you have opened the door?

43
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:10,740
All thirty days are on my channel.

